  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Imani House, Inc. has provided Adult Education services to the Liberian people since 1993.  Between then and now the project has served thousands of people with literacy and math classes and operates sites at Duala Markets and VOA . All present and past students in the program were/are of low educational standing, the majority living in abject poverty.</narrative>
